  "question": {
    "text": "\\(A, B\\) are fixed points with coordinates \\((0, a)\\) and \\((0, b)(a > 0, b > 0)\\). \\(P\\) is variable point \\((x, 0)\\) referred to rectangular axis. If the angle \\(\\angle \\mathrm{APB}\\) is maximum, then",
